  "query_preview": "..\nIssued at 252 PM EDT Sun Oct 4 2026\n\n- Dry weather expected for much of this week\n\nStrong high pressure building in will bring dry weather through\nmuch of the week. Northwesterly flow aloft Tuesday through late\nthis week brings with it some chance for very light rain...though\nnot much in the way of moisture will be available for producing\nanything too heavy or to widespread. Best chance for that should\nbe north of the forecast area. \n\n- Limited chance of frost Tonight...Better chance Monday Night\n\nNon-zero chance for pockets of frost tonight in our far northern \nzones but lower levels should remained mixed enough tonight to \nkeep the temperatures up. There is a better chance for frost \nMonday night into early Tuesday with less wind and clouds.",
